1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:05,350
Aerelia. A world above the clouds.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:09,750
A place where life floated in the sky.

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,900
What is happening?

4
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:19,850
Emergency! A Chronostorm is approaching Aerelia!

5
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:25,750
It bends space...

6
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:30,450
...and fractures time!

7
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:35,300
Our world is breaking apart!

8
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,050
What can we do?

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:46,650
Find the Crossroads of Worlds!

10
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:52,400
I'll find it!

11
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:55,200
And so, Mika set off into the unknown.

12
00:00:57,050 --> 00:01:01,550
But the storm was faster.

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:07,300
No! It found me!

14
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,600
Aaaah!

